 fill=\"#7c3aed\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" direction=\"rtl\">حُكَّامٌ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">haakim → hukkaam</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Fu''aal pattern</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: Ba'z alfaaz ki jama aakhir mein (ـُونَ) lagaaye baghair wahid lafz ke andar tabdeeli se banti hai (Jama Mukassar).</text>\n</svg>\n</div>Pehle column ke teenon alfaaz aap parh chuke hain. Doosre column mein unhi alfaaz ki jama banaayi gayi hai, lekin guzishta sabaq ki tarah unke aakhir mein (وْنَ) nahin lagaaya gaya balke wahid ke lafz mein hi tabdeeli ya kuchh huroof ke izaafe se jama bani hai. Inhein yaad kar lijiye:","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"58\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <rect y=\"42\" width=\"800\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\